WEBVTT

00:07:59.099 --> 00:08:00.434
(Laughter)

00:08:01.393 --> 00:08:03.729
As your inner weather gets balmier,

00:08:03.729 --> 00:08:06.607
because you've learned
how to high-five your demons,

00:08:06.607 --> 00:08:09.193
that shows up in your relationships
with other people.

00:08:09.193 --> 00:08:12.363
And because relationships
are probably the most important variable

00:08:12.363 --> 00:08:14.114
when it comes to human flourishing,

00:08:14.114 --> 00:08:16.283
your inner weather improves even further

00:08:16.283 --> 00:08:17.535
and up you go.

00:08:17.576 --> 00:08:19.203
And that is the whole point here.

00:08:19.245 --> 00:08:22.456
Self-love, properly understood,
not as narcissism,

00:08:22.498 --> 00:08:24.792
but as having your own back,

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:26.460
is not selfish.

00:08:27.419 --> 00:08:29.463
It makes you better
at loving other people.

00:08:29.505 --> 00:08:32.174
And the flip side of this
was on full display in my 360.